+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,19 @@
 # gpq-tiles
 
+> ## ⚠️ Renamed: `gpq-tiles` is now **tylertoo**
+>
+> This project has been renamed. Development continues at
+> **[geoparquet-io/tylertoo](https://github.com/geoparquet-io/tylertoo)** — nothing further will be
+> published under the `gpq-tiles` name.
+>
+> **Migrate:** `cargo install tylertoo` (was `cargo install gpq-tiles`) ·
+> `pip install tylertoo` (was `pip install gpq-tiles`).
+> In Rust, depend on [`tylertoo-core`](https://crates.io/crates/tylertoo-core) instead of
+> `gpq-tiles-core`; in Python, `import tylertoo` instead of `import gpq_tiles`.
+>
+> `0.6.1` is a metadata-only tombstone release — the code is unchanged from `0.6.0`, so anything
+> pinned to `gpq-tiles ~0.6` keeps working exactly as before.
+
 [![CI](https://github.com/geoparquet-io/gpq-tiles/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/geoparquet-io/gpq-tiles/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
 [![codecov](https://codecov.io/gh/geoparquet-io/gpq-tiles/branch/main/graph/badge.svg)](https://codecov.io/gh/geoparquet-io/gpq-tiles)
 [![Crates.io](https://img.shields.io/crates/v/gpq-tiles?color=blue)](https://crates.io/crates/gpq-tiles)
